{"parentUuid":"f7b23b25-c47f-4e68-a51e-d00f2ec8e943","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C4XkgJHTVmjjoZPhB64PBN","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Factorio NP-hard belt balancer academic paper benchmark\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Balancer mechanics - Factorio Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.factorio.com/Balancer_mechanics\"},{\"title\":\"Command line belt balancer analyzer - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=34182\"},{\"title\":\"Belt Balancers - how they work and how to make them - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=61424\"},{\"title\":\"8x8 Belt Balancer (76-tile footprint) - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=114011\"},{\"title\":\"Learning Solver Design: Automating Factorio Balancers\",\"url\":\"https://gianlucaventurini.com/posts/2024/factorio-sat\"},{\"title\":\"Belt Balancer (Improved Performance) - Factorio Mods\",\"url\":\"https://mods.factorio.com/mod/belt-balancer-performance\"},{\"title\":\"Optimal belt balancing in Factorio - Olivier Corradi's blog\",\"url\":\"https://oliviercorradi.com/blog/factorio-belt-balancer/\"},{\"title\":\"The Factory Must Grow: Automation in Factorio Kenneth N. Reid\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2102.04871\"},{\"title\":\"Belt Balancer - Factorio Mods\",\"url\":\"https://mods.factorio.com/mod/belt-balancer\"},{\"title\":\"Raynquist's Belt Balancers Fall 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.factorio.school/view/-ML5RsMXhj7tnbbzs02H\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about the computational complexity of Factorio belt balancers:\n\nBelt balancing from the Factorio video game is NP complexity, according to a blog post by Gianluca Venturini discussing solver design for automating Factorio balancers. It's possible to solve by hand small versions, allowing us to check correctness, but it quickly becomes impossible to humanly solve even for medium size balancers that are very useful in the game.\n\nAdditionally, there is an academic paper titled \"The Factory Must Grow: Automation in Factorio\" by Kenneth N. Reid that appears in the arXiv database. This paper discusses various approaches to solving factory layout and design problems in Factorio, including reinforcement learning, genetic programming and classical metaheuristic techniques for testing solutions to logistics problems in the game.\n\nHowever, my search did not return a specific academic paper that comprehensively benchmarks NP-hardness of belt balancer design with formal computational complexity proofs. The results show that the complexity is recognized in the community, but a dedicated peer-reviewed academic paper specifically focused on benchmarking this complexity may not be widely available or indexed.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"a0c23d87-2658-4b4f-a84b-1ffb00a8bb5f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:27.435Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f7b23b25-c47f-4e68-a51e-d00f2ec8e943","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b113c642-c923-4a6a-a780-62e5fdd75d5d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0164NCkkP4NrRt5XCk8K3W4j","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints\" ModRef 2023 paper constraint programming\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints Sean Patterson #\",\"url\":\"https://modref.github.io/papers/ModRef2023_TowardsAutomaticDesignOfFactorioBlueprints.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Towards automatic design of factorio blueprints - University of St Andrews Research Portal\",\"url\":\"https://research-portal.st-andrews.ac.uk/en/publications/towards-automatic-design-of-factorio-blueprints/\"},{\"title\":\"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2310.01505\"},{\"title\":\"[2310.01505] Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints\",\"url\":\"https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2310.01505\"},{\"title\":\"Blueprint Sandboxes - Factorio Mods\",\"url\":\"https://mods.factorio.com/mod/blueprint-sandboxes\"},{\"title\":\"Recursive Blueprints+ - Factorio Mods\",\"url\":\"https://mods.factorio.com/mod/rec-blue-plus\"},{\"title\":\"auto-generating blueprints - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=98600\"},{\"title\":\"Factorio Prints\",\"url\":\"https://www.factorio.school/\"},{\"title\":\"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints - ADS\",\"url\":\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023arXiv231001505P/abstract\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - covertcj/factorio-blueprint-designer: A Factorio mod that gives you creative-mode style side areas to test/design blueprints in. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/covertcj/factorio-blueprint-designer\"}]\n\nI found the paper you're looking for! Here's what I can tell you about it:\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n\"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints\" is a paper by Patterson, S., Espasa Arxer, J., Chang, M. S., & Hoffmann, R., presented at The 22nd workshop on Constraint Modelling and Reformulation (ModRef 2023) in Toronto, Canada.\n\n## Research Focus\n\nThe design of an optimal blueprint is a hard combinatorial problem, interleaving elements of many well-studied problems such as bin-packing, routing or network design. The work presents a new challenging problem and explores the feasibility of a constraint model to optimise Factorio blueprints, balancing correctness, optimality, and performance.\n\n## Approach\n\nGiven preliminary experimental results, a single optimisation model was shown to be infeasible for solving non-trivial blueprints. Therefore, in the spirit of a Benders decomposition approach, they implemented a multi-stage solution that splits the problem into three models.\n\n## Paper Location\n\nThe full paper is available at https://modref.github.io/papers/ModRef2023_TowardsAutomaticDesignOfFactorioBlueprints.pdf, and there's also a GitHub repository at https://github.com/stacs-cp/ModRef23-Factorio.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3a675523-3729-48e4-97c2-9250cfc6e204","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:27.646Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b113c642-c923-4a6a-a780-62e5fdd75d5d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ced7fce7-2548-4f3d-a51d-0a96513fb2e8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011YBvh4CBWM1FyLdPcsw59i","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 工业规划 求解器 工厂布局 optimizer bilibili\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建作业-集成援助活动第二期！完整版！一键毕业蓝图&摆完挂机！包含全阶段攻略！集成援助·掌中救星！\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wiR6BpEbP/\"},{\"title\":\"任意产线一键规划！终末地工业最强辅助工具-量化计算器正式上线 - 明日方舟：终末地攻略 - TapTap 明日方舟：终末地论坛\",\"url\":\"https://www.taptap.cn/moment/762328974700315026\"},{\"title\":\"[终末地] 基建美学 武陵1.2上半毕业基建蓝图 模块化_哔哩哔哩_bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yHoxBpEGV/\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】1.2模块化作业最新售后! 废液0浪费 紫药赫铜如何选择 新增液化重息壤蓝图_游戏热门视频\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XwoZBxEk5/\"},{\"title\":\"P社要发行自己的幸福工厂？我来尝尝咸淡_游戏杂谈\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sRoyBCE1A/\"},{\"title\":\"任意产线一键规划！终末地工业最强辅助工具-量化计算器正式上线！_明日方舟\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNBYBkE8f/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》工业开荒规划与产线布局分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080424.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建毕业蓝图攻略！一个视频看懂四号谷地+武陵毕业！ |魔法Zc目录\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s76FBGEow/\"},{\"title\":\"终末地 1.2 下半地图！试验园区提前打卡！_游戏热门视频\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ttoCBGENy/\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】懒人福音1.2基建活动全流程蓝图！从头到尾带你做完活动阶段1-3！商店搬空调度卷产出全覆盖！集成援助掌中救星&适用1.2下半_游戏热门视频\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cU96BnENZ/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found regarding your query about \"终末地 工业规划 求解器 工厂布局 optimizer bilibili\":\n\n## Key Finding: 终末地量化计算器 (Endfield Quantitative Calculator)\n\nThe Endfield Quantitative Calculator has been developed and deployed, which can calculate the optimal solution for industrial systems given specific requirements and constraints, assisting administrators with planning and building industrial systems.\n\n**Tool Access:**\n- Calculator address: https://factory.ef.yituliu.cn/\n- Project address: https://github.com/endfield-calc/factoriolab\n\n## Related Content on Bilibili\n\nThe search results show extensive Bilibili content related to 终末地 (Endfield) industrial planning and factory layout blueprints, including:\n\n- A widely popular video about the quantitative calculator with over 183,000 views and 26,774 likes\n- Multiple tutorial videos about factory layout optimization and modular construction blueprints\n- Discussions about production line design (产线) for various industrial products\n\nThe calculator appears to be the primary \"optimizer\" tool mentioned in your search query, designed specifically to help players plan optimal factory layouts in 终末地.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"459991a7-3ea9-4558-84dd-947caa713186","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:29.539Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ced7fce7-2548-4f3d-a51d-0a96513fb2e8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9653e850-435e-467c-ae09-b1fb36a1e838","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W3aiJiJ5HVv737FHaUwkoi","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Factorio Helmod Foreman YAFC algorithm production planner\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - ShadowTheAge/yafc: Powerful Factorio calculator/analyser that works with mods · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ShadowTheAge/yafc\"},{\"title\":\"YAFC - Factorio calculator/analyser for modded games - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=85215\"},{\"title\":\"Helmod: Assistant for planning your factory - Factorio Mods\",\"url\":\"https://mods.factorio.com/mod/helmod\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Yafc-CE/yafc-ce: Powerful Factorio calculator/analyser that works with mods · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Yafc-CE/yafc-ce\"},{\"title\":\"Helmod vs Factory Planner - Factorio Forums\",\"url\":\"https://forums.factorio.com/viewtopic.php?t=83852\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - petebuffon/yafc: Powerful Factorio calculator/analyser that works with mods\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/petebuffon/yafc\"},{\"title\":\"What is the best factory planner mod? :: Factorio General Discussions\",\"url\":\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/427520/discussions/0/685239206088313280/\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - ApocDev/yafc-ce: Powerful Factorio calculator/analyser that works with mods\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/ApocDev/yafc-ce\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - aliu-here/yafc-ce: Powerful Factorio calculator/analyser that works with mods; trying to add checkbox to show if a recipe has been built\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/aliu-here/yafc-ce\"},{\"title\":\"What are the best Factorio calculators … | Ship Games FAQ\",\"url\":\"https://www.ship.games/faq/factorio-calculator\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about these Factorio production planning tools:\n\n## Tools Overview\n\nYAFC is a Factorio calculator, planner and analyser, and its main goal is to cope with heavily modded games. It contains multiple analysis algorithms and tries to understand what is going on in your modpack.\n\nHelmod is an assistant for planning your factory that can calculate required ingredients, products, machines, modules, and beacons.\n\nForeman allows users to do some graphical layouts of builds quickly.\n\n## Key Algorithmic Differences\n\nA significant difference between these tools is their approach to balancing: Helmod tries to balance anything that has production and consumption, often resulting in infeasible models on deeply recursive recipes. In contrast, YAFC will try to balance production/consumption only for linked goods, while unlinked goods are calculated but no attempt to balance is made.\n\nYAFC handles recursive recipes extremely well and uses Google OrTools as its model solver.\n\n## Use Cases\n\nIn the category of planning tools Helmod and Factory Planner are the top of the line and the trend setters. However, YAFC can be a bit overkill and take longer to learn how to use unless you are doing a very complex set of mods like Pyanodon's mods.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"71333c7a-3f04-46ad-bab9-5a36586f317c","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:30.357Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9653e850-435e-467c-ae09-b1fb36a1e838","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
