{"parentUuid":"8a456f78-b68a-4488-9b10-13662b863bab","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LgeYj4bLjLq6KJjDwRiDx8","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"factorio reddit \"tried to solve\" placement layout failed quit gave up combinatorial\"\n\nNo links found.\n\nThe search returned no results for that specific query. The combination of exact phrases doesn't appear to match any indexed content on the web. \n\nYou might have better luck with:\n- A broader search using fewer or different keywords\n- Searching without the exact phrase quotations\n- Trying key terms separately (like just \"factorio reddit placement layout\" or \"factorio quit gave up\")\n\nWould you like me to try a different search approach?\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1b38bea3-5fc5-4ae7-8f4a-57b427ed4bc3","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:00:56.785Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8a456f78-b68a-4488-9b10-13662b863bab","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1c6cbdab-8575-448c-9b97-226dd4c5b2b2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6f37bbaf-3b2a-4889-9da8-014105b65b82","agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017CTnA94biwft3yKYKmeii5","type":"tool_result","content":"I can only see the title \"终末地量化计算器\" (which translates to \"Endgame Quantification Calculator\") from the webpage content provided. \n\nUnfortunately, this limited information doesn't allow me to answer your specific questions about:\n- Whether it handles factory layout/grid placement or just production ratios\n- What algorithm it employs\n- Whether a GitHub repository exists\n\nTo get accurate answers, you would need to visit the full webpage, check its documentation, or look for a GitHub link directly on the site. The title alone suggests it's a calculation tool for an endgame-related game, but I cannot determine its specific functionality without additional content."}]},"uuid":"1c1389f2-95b8-4921-a7da-848611dfb383","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:00.845Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1c6cbdab-8575-448c-9b97-226dd4c5b2b2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1c1389f2-95b8-4921-a7da-848611dfb383","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a573a93d8823d4dbd","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Ryd2xrqRZwZctTfnogKZGM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough to write a thorough report. Here's the synthesis.\n\n---\n\n# 工厂模拟游戏社区求解器调研报告\n\n## 具体项目清单（按算法类别）\n\n**1. Factorio-SAT (R-O-C-K-E-T)** — https://github.com/R-O-C-K-E-T/Factorio-SAT\nSAT 求解器（自研编码）做平衡器（belt balancer）综合。规模：8x8 平衡器约 83 秒（带 symmetry breaking），16x16 约 5.3 小时。结论：偏离最优在 1 格以内，工程上认为\"实操最优\"。**直接对标我们 70x70：他们公开能搞的极限是 16x16。**\n\n**2. Venturini 的 CP-SAT 平衡器实验** — https://gianlucaventurini.com/posts/2024/factorio-sat\n用 SCIP MIP + Google OR-Tools CP-SAT。2x2: 0.19s，4x4: 19s，8x8: 36 分钟，16x16: 5.3 小时。教训和我们高度同源：discretize flow（避免浮点）、对称性破缺、目标函数加 component 数量能把 16x16 从几小时压到 30 分钟。\n\n**3. ModRef 2023 论文 \"Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints\"** — https://arxiv.org/html/2310.01505 + https://github.com/stacs-cp/ModRef23-Factorio\nPatterson et al.（圣安德鲁斯）。**明确说明用类 Benders 多阶段分解** —— 单一模型不可行，必须分阶段。用 Essence Prime + Savile Row + 多后端求解器。规模：~100 格（如 8x8），几分钟出结果，再大就\"runtimes increase rapidly and soon become intractable\"。**这是和我们架构最像的学术工作。**\n\n**4. verifactory (alegnani)** — https://github.com/alegnani/verifactory\n用 z3 SMT 验证已有 blueprint 的逻辑性质（不是综合，是验证）。规模没限制，验证比综合便宜很多。\n\n**5. YAFC (ShadowTheAge / Yafc-CE)** — https://github.com/Yafc-CE/yafc-ce\n**用的就是 Google OR-Tools** 做生产链平衡（recipe ratio + module 优化），不做空间布局。Pyanodons 这类几千 recipe 的 modpack 也能跑。\n\n**6. NeuralCoder3/factorio_recipe_planner** — https://github.com/NeuralCoder3/factorio_recipe_planner\n配方+品质模块的 MIP/SMT，支持 z3 / python-mip / Gurobi 三个后端。只解 recipe-level，不解空间。\n\n**7. reinderien/factorio + Rotsor/factorio-lp** — https://github.com/reinderien/factorio, https://github.com/Rotsor/factorio-lp\n线性规划做经济学/比例分析。纯 LP，不做 placement。\n\n**8. kevinburke/factorio-layout-optimizer** — https://github.com/kevinburke/factorio-layout-optimizer\n做 block 层级布局，承认局限：\"不规划 block 间连接 belt 空间，block 不能旋转\"——直接放弃了我们要做的东西。\n\n**9. elswindle/factorio_annealer** — https://github.com/elswindle/factorio_annealer\n**模拟退火**做 city-block 工厂布局。启发式，不保证最优，但能跑大规模。\n\n**10. Reid 2021 \"The Factory Must Grow\"** — https://arxiv.org/pdf/2102.04871\n学术 benchmark：SA / GP / Evolutionary RL 三种元启发式比较，**全部是 metaheuristic，明确放弃 exact**。\n\n**11. 终末地量化计算器（鹰角社区/一图流）** — https://factory.ef.yituliu.cn/，仓库 https://github.com/endfield-calc/factoriolab\n**直接 fork 了 FactorioLab**。**只算 recipe ratio 和需求清单，不解空间布局。** B 站 18 万播放量，是终末地玩家最大的工业辅助工具——**没人做 placement 求解。**\n\n**12. Satisfactory Tools / Modeler** — https://www.satisfactorytools.com/\nrecipe-level 用 LP（社区代码用 scipy.optimize.linprog），布局图用 ELK 自动布线（启发式 graph layout，非最优）。\n\n## 社区主流方法总结\n\n- **Recipe-level（要算多少机器）**：清一色 LP / MIP，OR-Tools 用得最多（YAFC、NeuralCoder3、Satisfactory 社区都用）。这层社区已经搞定了，规模能上几千 recipe。\n- **Placement-level（具体摆哪里）**：**社区基本都跪了**。学术最优解 ~100 格上限，再大用模拟退火 / 遗传算法 / 强化学习的启发式。\n- **Belt routing（连线布线）**：SAT/CP 编码（Factorio-SAT、Venturini），16x16 是公开能达到的极限。\n- **没有任何社区项目尝试 70x70 + 266 facility 的精确求解**。最接近的 ModRef 2023 明说 100 格以上就 intractable。\n\n## 对我们项目的借鉴价值评估\n\n**高价值借鉴点**：\n1. **Benders 分解不是我们独创** —— ModRef 2023 走的就是这条路，且是被\"single model 不可行\"逼出来的，验证我们架构选择正确。\n2. **Venturini 的工程教训直接可用**：discretize flow（我们已做）、symmetry breaking、目标函数里加最小化件数能加速一个数量级。\n3. **YAFC 用 OR-Tools 跑大规模 recipe 网络的经验**——证明 OR-Tools 在 modded factory 域是工业级靠谱的。\n\n**警示点**：\n1. 整个工厂游戏社区**没有先例**做到我们这个量级（70x70 / 266）的 exact placement。这不是说不可能，而是说我们要做开创性工作，**不要指望抄作业**。\n2. 玩家社区的 UX 容忍是\"几秒到几分钟\"。我们 168 小时 campaign 是不同物种，定位是 offline proof，不是交互工具——**这个区别要在文档里写清楚**，避免被人拿玩家工具来做错误对照。\n3. ModRef 论文明说他们做了简化（single-item-per-tile、忽略 final flow rate），我们没简化反而追 certified_exact——**我们的难度上限高于已有学术工作，要对求解时间有现实预期**。\n\n**没什么用的方向**：\n- SA / GA / RL 的启发式社区路线对我们 certified_exact 路径无意义（违反 exactness constitution）。可作为 exploratory 路径的灵感，但严格隔离。\n- 终末地玩家社区**目前没有空间求解器**，量化计算器只做需求侧——也就是说我们做出来就是这个生态第一个，没有可直接借鉴的同游戏前作。\n\nSources:\n- [Factorio-SAT (R-O-C-K-E-T)](https://github.com/R-O-C-K-E-T/Factorio-SAT)\n- [Learning Solver Design: Automating Factorio Balancers (Venturini)](https://gianlucaventurini.com/posts/2024/factorio-sat)\n- [Towards Automatic Design of Factorio Blueprints (ModRef 2023)](https://arxiv.org/html/2310.01505)\n- [ModRef23-Factorio repo](https://github.com/stacs-cp/ModRef23-Factorio)\n- [verifactory (z3 SMT verifier)](https://github.com/alegnani/verifactory)\n- [YAFC-CE (OR-Tools recipe planner)](https://github.com/Yafc-CE/yafc-ce)\n- [NeuralCoder3/factorio_recipe_planner](https://github.com/NeuralCoder3/factorio_recipe_planner)\n- [reinderien/factorio LP](https://github.com/reinderien/factorio)\n- [Rotsor/factorio-lp](https://github.com/Rotsor/factorio-lp)\n- [kevinburke/factorio-layout-optimizer](https://github.com/kevinburke/factorio-layout-optimizer)\n- [elswindle/factorio_annealer (Simulated Annealing)](https://github.com/elswindle/factorio_annealer)\n- [Reid 2021 \"The Factory Must Grow\"](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2102.04871)\n- [终末地量化计算器](https://factory.ef.yituliu.cn/)\n- [endfield-calc/factoriolab](https://github.com/endfield-calc/factoriolab)\n- [Satisfactory Tools](https://www.satisfactorytools.com/)\n- [TapTap 终末地量化计算器讨论](https://www.taptap.cn/moment/762328974700315026)\n- [B站量化计算器视频](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XNBYBkE8f/)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":239,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_read_input_tokens":35336,"output_tokens":3169,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":512},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":239,"output_tokens":3169,"cache_read_input_tokens":35336,"cache_creation_input_tokens":512,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":512,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caot93uUrkJHW3uDWsSpS","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa0fd27c-8ffd-4f21-8666-b145be37d792","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:01:59.835Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
